ion\": \"unknown\",\n      \"storage_requirements\": \"moderate\",\n      \"access_patterns\": \"Likely query patterns include filtering by customer_id, city/state/country, or pincode and geospatial range queries using latitude/longitude. Joins to a customers table are plausible in typical usage but no FOREIGN KEY constraint is declared in the DDL. Workload is likely read-heavy for lookups and geospatial queries with periodic writes for address inserts/updates.\"\n    },\n    \"table_summary\": {\n      \"total_columns\": 10,\n      \"raw_ddl\": \"CREATE TABLE Address (\\n    address_id      VARCHAR(20) ,\\n    customer_id     VARCHAR(20) ,\\n    address_line1   VARCHAR(200) ,\\n    address_line2   VARCHAR(200),\\n    city            VARCHAR(50),\\n    state           VARCHAR(50),\\n    country         VARCHAR(50),\\n    pincode         VARCHAR(10),\\n    latitude        NUMERIC(10,6),\\n    longitude       NUMERIC(10,6),\\n\\n);\\n\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```","x":820,"y":1300,"width":440,"height":900},
